Subject: [PATCH] test(claude-eval): passage probes on c8fdc21: P1 regression,
 recomputed forgery refused with trusted metadata, P3 (strict xfail)

Replaces patch 0021, base e61f3d1. Pinned: coverage, determinism, identity
bound to document/revision/configuration, edits and shifts refused, P1
(another document, revision or passage_id) refused, a recomputed forgery
refused when trusted document_id/revision are given. P3: both remain
optional; the identity is an unkeyed hash, so a self-consistent forgery for
another owner verifies when a caller omits them.

